{"logId": "f8b85134-5022-463d-9dfe-8a4ba023d8fc", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1920, "height": 1080, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——理财", "block_bbox": [311, 120, 734, 164], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[311.0, 120.0], [734.0, 120.0], [734.0, 164.0], [311.0, 164.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "一级【0~1分】：不因物质、金钱等给自己或他人造成沉重的经济压力、精神包袱，甚至痛苦和伤害。（底线原则）", "block_bbox": [307, 231, 1521, 307], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[307.0, 231.0], [1521.0, 231.0], [1521.0, 307.0], [307.0, 307.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：对金钱和物质的过度追求会让人产生急功近利、不劳而获等错误的思维和行为，对人的精神、心理等各方面造成不同程度的危害，甚至误入歧途。同时也要建立强烈的财产安全意识和财产风险把控能力。无论什么样的情况下，都不能因物质、金钱等给自己或他人造成沉重的经济压力、精神包袱，甚至痛苦和伤害，这是底线原则。", "block_bbox": [307, 351, 1553, 521], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[307.0, 351.0], [1553.0, 351.0], [1553.0, 521.0], [307.0, 521.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "- 不符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [311, 586, 509, 618], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[311.0, 586.0], [509.0, 586.0], [509.0, 618.0], [311.0, 618.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、以赢钱、获利为目的的娱乐或赌博行为", "block_bbox": [336, 644, 832, 676], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[336.0, 644.0], [832.0, 644.0], [832.0, 676.0], [336.0, 676.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、炒股、投资、理财、放贷、借贷、担保等高利或高风险行为", "block_bbox": [336, 689, 1066, 721], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[336.0, 689.0], [1066.0, 689.0], [1066.0, 721.0], [336.0, 721.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、有超出个人偿还或承受能力的相互借款、贷款、信用卡消费等", "block_bbox": [336, 734, 1095, 766], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[336.0, 734.0], [1095.0, 734.0], [1095.0, 766.0], [336.0, 766.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、缺乏财产安全意识，被盗、被诈骗等导致财产损失", "block_bbox": [337, 779, 965, 810], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[337.0, 779.0], [965.0, 779.0], [965.0, 810.0], [337.0, 810.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、套用信用卡为自己或他人获利", "block_bbox": [336, 824, 728, 855], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[336.0, 824.0], [728.0, 824.0], [728.0, 855.0], [336.0, 855.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、提供个人身份证给他人使用，被套用征信用于贷款、担保、抵押等", "block_bbox": [336, 868, 1147, 901], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[336.0, 868.0], [1147.0, 868.0], [1147.0, 901.0], [336.0, 901.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[76]", "block_bbox": [914, 968, 958, 993], "block_id": 10, "block_order": null, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[914.0, 968.0], [957.0, 968.0], [957.0, 992.0], [914.0, 992.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.856200635433197, "coordinate": [311, 120, 734, 164], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[311.0, 120.0], [734.0, 120.0], [734.0, 164.0], [311.0, 164.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8718579411506653, "coordinate": [307, 231, 1521, 307], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[307.0, 231.0], [1521.0, 231.0], [1521.0, 307.0], [307.0, 307.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.954245388507843, "coordinate": [307, 351, 1553, 521], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[307.0, 351.0], [1553.0, 351.0], [1553.0, 521.0], [307.0, 521.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8355216979980469, "coordinate": [311, 586, 509, 618], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[311.0, 586.0], [509.0, 586.0], [509.0, 618.0], [311.0, 618.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8231241703033447, "coordinate": [336, 644, 832, 676], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[336.0, 644.0], [832.0, 644.0], [832.0, 676.0], [336.0, 676.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8383320569992065, "coordinate": [336, 689, 1066, 721], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[336.0, 689.0], [1066.0, 689.0], [1066.0, 721.0], [336.0, 721.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8380233645439148, "coordinate": [336, 734, 1095, 766], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[336.0, 734.0], [1095.0, 734.0], [1095.0, 766.0], [336.0, 766.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8301817774772644, "coordinate": [337, 779, 965, 810], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[337.0, 779.0], [965.0, 779.0], [965.0, 810.0], [337.0, 810.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8253324627876282, "coordinate": [336, 824, 728, 855], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[336.0, 824.0], [728.0, 824.0], [728.0, 855.0], [336.0, 855.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8406274914741516, "coordinate": [336, 868, 1147, 901], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[336.0, 868.0], [1147.0, 868.0], [1147.0, 901.0], [336.0, 901.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.7241149544715881, "coordinate": [914, 968, 958, 993], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[914.0, 968.0], [957.0, 968.0], [957.0, 992.0], [914.0, 992.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 考评奖励标准——理财\n\n## 一 级【0~1分】：不因物质、金钱等给自己或他人造成沉重的经济压力、精神包袱，甚至痛苦和伤害。（底线原则）\n\n- 本条释义：对金钱和物质的过度追求会让人产生急功近利、不劳而获等错误的思维和行为，对人的精神、心理等各方面造成不同程度的危害，甚至误入歧途。同时也要建立强烈的财产安全意识和财产风险把控能力。无论什么样的情况下，都不能因物质、金钱等给自己或他人造成沉重的经济压力、精神包袱，甚至痛苦和伤害，这是底线原则。\n\n## - 不符合的行为：\n\n1、以赢钱、获利为目的的娱乐或赌博行为\n\n2、炒股、投资、理财、放贷、借贷、担保等高利或高风险行为\n\n3、有超出个人偿还或承受能力的相互借款、贷款、信用卡消费等\n\n4、缺乏财产安全意识，被盗、被诈骗等导致财产损失\n\n5、套用信用卡为自己或他人获利\n\n6、提供个人身份证给他人使用，被套用征信用于贷款、担保、抵押等", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//f8b85134-5022-463d-9dfe-8a4ba023d8fc/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A39%3A56Z%2F-1%2F%2F14e3b884d77570dfa818686edc44f82b36434978a1fda5927e286d6b7e55e6ee"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//f8b85134-5022-463d-9dfe-8a4ba023d8fc/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A39%3A56Z%2F-1%2F%2Ff0a2e7e93cce999a9435e9eb4a6f077bdd34a45fabbe41a15ecf6c1a6c681b1c"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1920, "height": 1080}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//f8b85134-5022-463d-9dfe-8a4ba023d8fc/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A39%3A56Z%2F-1%2F%2F7f590a0c49a6bc628d141da0ecf9498283397a4be5d720de23c221e089fb6048"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
